WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.533
Video twenty-six. Hisaab Docs reads a bill
into a voucher.

00:00:04.733 --> 00:00:08.949
Hisaab Docs reads a bill: a photo, or a PDF.

00:00:08.879 --> 00:00:12.297
The fast reader works offline, on this PC.

00:00:12.228 --> 00:00:18.313
Then Hisaab checks the numbers: each line, the
GST, the total, and the GSTIN.

00:00:18.243 --> 00:00:21.195
You check the draft, and save it as a voucher.

00:00:21.495 --> 00:00:25.778
Alt+O opens Import. Hisaab Docs has its own
part of the menu.

00:00:26.858 --> 00:00:33.342
I opens the import of bills: the voucher type, the
mode, and the reader. F4 selects the files.

00:00:34.422 --> 00:00:39.440
Bills also come from your phone: Scan from
Phone. They wait in Draft Transactions.

00:00:41.422 --> 00:00:45.907
R opens Draft Transactions. Hisaab reads each
bill, and checks it.

00:00:49.203 --> 00:00:56.019
The bill of Mehta Fabrics passed every check. Enter shows
the voucher: the party, the items, and the GST.

00:00:56.049 --> 00:01:04.133
The bill of Kothari Textile needs action. Hisaab lists each
failed check: line 1, the CGST and SGST, and 7 more.

00:01:04.163 --> 00:01:09.715
Its voucher is not complete. You correct it from the
bill, or you reject the bill with Alt+X.

00:01:09.745 --> 00:01:14.297
F10 saves the checked draft of Mehta Fabrics
as a voucher.

00:01:16.745 --> 00:01:20.029
F8 shows the drafts that are now vouchers.

00:01:21.077 --> 00:01:25.160
Hisaab reads the bill and checks the numbers.
You check and save.

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:28.640
Next: help, the support file, and updates.

